  lines:
  - characterName: Panacea
    text: Okay, before I go, do I remember how to move?
  - characterName: Panacea
    text: "Oh, that\u2019s right! I use WASD to move!"
  - characterName: Panacea
    text: "Oh, there\u2019s a toy wheel right there! I remember Remy asking for toys\u2026  "
  - characterName: Panacea
    text: I can press E to pick it up!
